<div class="modal fade" id="resetModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="resetModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-header">
        <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="resetModalLabel">Factory Reset</h1>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
        </div>
        <div id="resetModalBody" class="modal-body">
        <b>Are you sure you want to do this?</b> You are about to delete all your feeds and feed items <b class="text-danger">permanently</b>.
        It is recommended you have downloaded your feeds list as OPML in the settings menu. <b class="text-danger">This action cannot be undone.</b>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer border-0">
            <button type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" class="btn btn-primary">Cancel</button>
            <button type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" class="btn btn-danger" onclick="localStorage.clear(); window.location.reload();">Reset</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    </div>
</div>